# The Android app's source project. It lives in this repository for
# development and is never part of the website: nothing here may answer an
# HTTP request, on WAMP or on the server.
#
# The Hestia deploy (.github/workflows/deploy.yml) also leaves every file in
# this folder except this one out of the upload, because nginx serves some
# file types there (.xml, .webp, .jar) directly, without ever asking Apache.

Require all denied
